,NULL,'2025-07-29 10:57:49','2025-07-29 10:57:49'),(367,'2025-07-29 11:51:11','sections','update','6','180.254.225.130','{\"data\":{\"id\":\"1\",\"section_name\":\"Section Herodfdfdfdfd\",\"section_category_id\":\"1\",\"section_name_jp\":null,\"slug\":\"test111111111111111\",\"slug_jp\":null,\"content\":\"<p>Rektor ITB STIKOM BALI<\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dr. Dadang Hermawan<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"content_jp\":null,\"status\":\"active\",\"status_jp\":\"\\u6709\\u52b9\\uff08\\u3086\\u3046\\u3053\\u3046\\uff09\",\"created_at\":\"2025-06-18T15:11:28.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-07-29T01:27:25.000000Z\",\"section_category_name\":\"test1\"}}','https://apijob.miraiakademi.com/sections/1',NULL,'2025-07-29 11:51:11','2025-07-29 11:51:11'),(368,'2025-07-29 11:59:14','sections','update','6','180.254.225.130','{\"data\":{\"id\":\"3\",\"section_name\":\"profile_section\",\"section_category_id\":\"1\",\"section_name_jp\":null,\"slug\":\"profile-section\",\"slug_jp\":null,\"content\":\"<h2>Mengenal Dr. Dadang Hermawan<\\/h2><p>Dr. Dadang Hermawan adalah seorang pendidik, pemimpin, dan pengusaha berpengalaman dengan lebih dari 40 tahun keahlian dalam manajemen pendidikan, keuangan, dan pengembangan kelembagaan. Memulai kariernya sebagai guru sekolah menengah dan peneliti, ia kemudian memegang peran sebagai auditor, manajer keuangan, dan penasihat Direktorat Jenderal Pajak.<\\/p><p>Ia adalah pendiri dan ketua sekaligus Rektor ITB STIKOM Bali dan telah mendirikan dan memimpin lebih dari 30 lembaga pendidikan di seluruh Indonesia, termasuk universitas, sekolah kejuruan (SMK), dan pusat pelatihan (LP3I, LPBA, Politeknik). Sebagai pemimpin yang visioner, ia telah berhasil mengintegrasikan pendidikan dengan kewirausahaan dan program tenaga kerja global.<\\/p>\",\"content_jp\":null,\"status\":\"active\",\"status_jp\":\"\\u6709\\u52b9\\uff08\\u3086\\u3046\\u3053\\u3046\\uff09\",\"created_at\":\"2025-06-19T00:21:45.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-07-01T10:53:56.000000Z\",\"section_category_name\":\"test1\"}}','https://apijob.miraiakademi.com/sections/3',NULL,'2025-07-29 11:59:14','2025-07-29 11:59:14'),(369,'2025-07-29 12:01:22','sections','update','6','180.254.225.130','{\"data\":{\"id\":\"1\",\"section_name\":\"test1------------------------\",\"section_category_id\":\"1\",\"section_name_jp\":null,\"slug\":\"section-herodfdfdfdfd\",\"slug_jp\":null,\"content\":\"<p>Rektor ITB STIKOM BALI<\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dr. Dadang Hermawan<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"content_jp\":null,\"status\":\"active\",\"status_jp\":\"\\u6709\\u52b9\\uff08\\u3086\\u3046\\u3053\\u3046\\uff09\",\"created_at\":\"2025-06-18T15:11:28.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-07-29T03:51:11.000000Z\"}}','https://apijob.miraiakademi.com/sections/1',NULL,'2025-07-29 12:01:22','2025-07-29 12:01:22'),(370,'2025-07-29 12:02:05','sections','update','6','180.254.225.130','{\"data\":{\"id\":\"1\",\"section_name\":\"test1121212121212\",\"section_category_id\":\"1\",\"section_name_jp\":null,\"slug\":\"test1\",\"slug_jp\":null,\"content\":\"<p>Rektor ITB STIKOM BALI jeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee<\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dr. Dadang Hermawan<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"content_jp\":null,\"status\":\"active\",\"status_jp\":\"\\u6709\\u52b9\\uff08\\u3086\\u3046\\u3053\\u3046\\uff09\",\"created_at\":\"2025-06-18T15:11:28.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-07-29T04:01:22.000000Z\"}}','https://apijob.miraiakademi.com/sections/1',NULL,'2025-07-29 12:02:05','2025-07-29 12:02:05'),(371,'2025-07-29 13:37:50','sections','delete','6','123.231.250.36','{\"data\":[]}','https://apijob.miraiakademi.com/sections/1',NULL,'2025-07-29 13:37:50','2025-07-29 13:37:50'),(372,'2025-07-29 13:37:54','sections','delete','6','123.231.250.36','{\"data\":[]}','https://apijob.miraiakademi.com/sections/3',NULL,'2025-07-29 13:37:54','2025-07-29 13:37:54'),(373,'2025-07-29 13:37:57','sections','delete','6','123.231.250.36','{\"data\":[]}','https://apijob.miraiakademi.com/sections/2',NULL,'202